Required command run: `bash editions/monroe-1.3/tools/sweep_probe.sh book-07-void-roads 1 8`. Movement totals were M1 1% skeleton / 13% close; M2 2/19; M3 2/22; M4 4/22; M5 6/21; M6 3/18; M7 3/18; M8 4/17. `SHOW=1` was run for every movement containing a qualifying chapter. The probe-named source chapters were opened only after this step.

Chapters at 6% skeleton or above were ch25 (9%), ch26 (7%), ch33 (6%), ch34 (10%), ch36 (12%), ch37 (8%), ch44 (8%), ch46 (6%), ch52 (6%), ch58 (6%) and ch60 (9%). Each was checked side by side against the source chapters named for its movement: source ch8–10, ch11–13, ch14–16, ch17–20 and ch21–24 respectively.

**Qualifying unprotected source-shaped passages: none.** There is therefore no chapter:line / source:line / kind table of findings. The whole-book eight-word overlap sweep independently reports **0 unprotected shared runs and 255 protected runs**.

