+### Movement 2 running judgment
+
+The thaw-to-first-boat line is coherent and the entry price is paid twice: through the strap rescue, then through Vastin's relinquishing of office and packet. The archive material is dense but can be followed by ear because Karis and Brom keep separating what a page says from what it cannot say. No premature theory appears. Calendar, money, fragment count, body states, custody, consent and knowledge perimeters hold through the night of day 277. Repetition watch intensifies around hands lying/closing on boards, `as a man/person…`, counts that “come out,” things priced/held/entered, and carefully repeated refusals to look or touch.
